  "solution": {
    "text": "Biconvex lens is cut perpendicularly to the principle axis, it will become a plano-convex lens.<br /><br />Focal length of biconvex lens<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8321;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8322;</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />For plano-convex lens<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8321;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Comparing Eqs. (i) and (ii), we see that focal length becomes double.<br /><br />Power of lens P <math><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence, power will become half.<br /><br />New power = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>",
